  "title": "Roasted Garlic and Onion with Rosemary",
  "blurb": "Soft, sweet onions and whole garlic cloves roasted until caramelised with fresh rosemary",
  "steps": [
    "Heat your oven to 200°C.",
    "Put the onion pieces into a roasting tin with the crushed garlic cloves.",
    "Drizzle over the olive oil, scatter the rosemary sprigs on top, and season with salt.",
    "Toss everything together with your hands so the vegetables are well coated.",
    "Roast for 40 minutes, stirring halfway through, until the onions are soft and golden at the edges.",
    "Squeeze the soft garlic from the skins before serving if you like."
